# BuildKit sidecar ignore for deploy/Dockerfile.rust (context = repo root).
# Honoured when building with `docker build -f deploy/Dockerfile.rust` under
# BuildKit (default in Compose v2 + the #syntax directive in the Dockerfile).
# Keeps the build context lean: no toolchain output, no editor/local state.

.git
.github
docs
target
**/target
node_modules
**/node_modules
web/dist
artifacts
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
/.claude
